Carried-forward SDKs

The TypeScript SDK packages carry forward source from The AI Alliance's Semiont
monorepo as it stood through 2026-08-26. This historical source is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream project is named to identify
the source and provenance of that material.

SDKs newly implemented after the boundary

An earlier Go SDK existed in the monorepo at `packages/sdk-go` on 2026-08-26.
The current Go SDK is a post-boundary rewrite of that earlier implementation.
The Rust, Python, C#, Kotlin, Swift, Haskell, and OCaml SDK packages were also
introduced after 2026-08-26 and were absent from the historical SDK package
tree. The earlier Go implementation remains only in the historical snapshot.

Xynoplex work

All work in these SDKs made on or after 2026-08-27, including the rewritten Go
SDK, the newly introduced language SDKs, and subsequent work on the carried-
forward TypeScript packages, is owned by Xynoplex. The repository history
records the pre-boundary source as a single snapshot commit, followed by the
post-boundary changes.

Third-party notices remain with the files or dependencies to which they apply.
